owing is the graph of $y=2x+2.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we fill the table. Given a value of $x$ we can find the corresponding $y$ by substituting $x$ into the formula $y=2x+2.$\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n- if $x=0$ then $y=2(0)+2=2,$\n\n- if $x=1$ then $y=2(1)+2=4,$\n\n- if $x=2$ then $y=2(2)+2=6,$ and\n\n- if $x=3$ then $y=2(3)+2=8.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $2$ | $4$ | $6$ | $8$ |\n\nPlotting these $(x,y)$ pairs on the $xy$-plane: \n\n![](images/6b/6b2da4bfc7c768788d143999fb61e76bb3a60facffc35e430d98085b395932f7.png)\n\nFinally, connecting the points gives us a straight line. This is the graph of  $y=2x+2.$\n\n![](images/04/0400a1437f26b74feb16161cf51a88c175ee6837fe1e5d8f8785ba2bb2b9c68b.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186497774 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06fa8c2f-5b1f-5063-8e88-0b913061880c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/30/30ea4f86a1a588cd617779bc001935f50b7fa358ecca86efeaf26bde27642627.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497766} {:answer/id #uuid "09af78ca-b5c2-58ed-aee4-4ddfc7a7f013" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f3/f3b91b84281ef5b4936438c7e92935cbaf15d17ee50b33a27a7bed638391ef74.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497767} {:answer/id #uuid "29968d51-b8a6-5bee-82fc-d738be24cc8b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/b9/b9758c660c06a62ba10ca7ced102655a3a8f376d31d9c4ef73ec9ea8b33e769b.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497770} {:answer/id #uuid "7083980a-a87f-5d35-b45a-36f6cd7e349b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/07/07b33747d01621cb73ae464999a8d6a135f0dc579f9e50b250f34b3df9ca4783.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186497779} {:answer/id #uuid "f90d513b-aef2-5217-be5f-bd7b7f1eafff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/05/05d10ee3d2e6bc295a7d2e6b0